rands and acquiring rights and IP”s​</p>\n\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-text\">\n                        <div class=\"centered myBtn\" data-company=\"Meta Form\">Get in Touch</div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n\n\n        <div id=\"myModal\" class=\"modal\">\n\n            <div class=\"form-success hide\">\n                <h3 style=\"color:#fff;\">Thank You for contacting us!</h3>\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"modal-content\">\n                <img src=\"assets/images/back-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" class=\"close\">\n                <div class=\"main-block\">\n                    <form action=\"/contactform.php\" id=\"contactform\" method=\"POST\" class=\"contact-from\"\n                        data-parsley-validate>\n                        <div class=\"info\">\n                            <input class=\"fname\" type=\"text\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Full name\" required>\n                            <input class=\"subject\" type=\"text\" name=\"subject\" placeholder=\"Subject\" required>\n                            <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email Address\" required>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"mobile\" name=\"phone\" placeholder=\"Contact No\" maxlength=\"10\"\n                                data-parsley-type=\"number\" required>\n                            <ul class=\"parsley-errors-list\">\n                                <li id=\"mobile_validation\"></li>\n                            </ul>\n                            <div>\n                                <textarea rows=\"4\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Message\"></textarea>\n                            </div>\n                            <input type=\"submit\" class=\"submit submit-btn\" value=\"Submit\">\n                        </div>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"our-purpose\" id=\"ourPurpose\">\n        <h4>Our Purpose</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"swiper purposeSlider container\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"1\">\n                    <div class=\"swiper-header\">\n                        <h2>01 CRO</h2>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-prev\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-next\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p>We believe in click economics making every click meaningful.\n\n                    Our CRO models are customised for individual brands to create a predictable and measurable \n                        avenue to point all consumers towards conversion - the ultimate success metric.\n                    </p>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"2\">\n                    <div class=\"swiper-header\">\n                        <h2>02 SOCIAL COMMERCE</h2>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-prev\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-next\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>\n                        We capitalise on the power of micro moments experienced by buyers on social media platforms. Our social commerce solutions simplify the journey of see it, love it, buy it.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"3\">\n                    <div class=\"swiper-header\">\n                        <h2>03 02020</h2>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-prev\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-next\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>\n                        We are enablers of a multi touchpoint experience for brands that intend to make an impact across offline, online and connected realms. We plot, integrate & study unique 02020 road maps to build brands that truly have a 360º impact on the increasingly connected consumer.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"4\">\n                    <div class=\"swiper-header\">\n                        <h2>04 NAYA BHARAT</h2>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-prev\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-next\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p>\n                        Our Naya Bharat endeavour enables brands to meet the diverse expectations of non-urban India. Our regional specialists embrace the cultural contexts of modern day Bharat to craft solutions with deeper relatability and nuance.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"5\">\n                    <div class=\"swiper-header\">\n                        <h2>05 WEB 3.0</h2>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-prev\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"swiper-button-next\">\n                            <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>\n                        Our Web 3.0 practice  aims to orchestrate the mass migration of communities from Web 2.0 to Web 3.0 by enabling communities to socialise, play and transact in Web 3.0.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div thumbsSlider=\"\" class=\"swiper mySwiper2 container\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"1\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/CRO.png\" />\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"2\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/socail-commerce1.jpg\" />\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"3\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/0202.jpg\" />\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"4\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/naya-bharat.jpg\" />\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"5\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/web-3.jpg\" />\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"clientele-section container\" id=\"clientele\">\n        <h3>Some of our Clientele</h3>\n\n        <div class=\"swiper clientele container\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/3.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/6.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/7.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/8.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/9.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/10.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/11.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/12.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/Sandisk.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/14.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/15.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/16.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/17.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/18.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/19.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/clientele-logos/20.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"logo\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"swiper-button-prev\">\n                <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"swiper-button-next\">\n                <img src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"start-project\">\n        <div class=\"start-project-inner container\">\n            <img src=\"assets/images/start-project-logo.png\" />\n            <h2>\n                A Global Independent Digital Marketing Network\n                </h2>\n                <a class=\"zoo-btn-secondary\" href=\"/contact.html\">\n                    Start a project\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/redirect.svg\" />\n                </a>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"cautious\">\n        <p>Be cautious of job scams impersonating the Zoo Media Network, Foxymoron or our other agencies. Verify the authenticity of messages using our <a href=\"https://foxymoron.in/careers/\">Communication Verification Tool</a>.</p>\n        <span id=\"cautious-close\">\n            <img class=\"bottom-close-icon\" src=\"https://stagingfoxymoron.noesis.dev/wp-content/themes/borgholm-child/assets/images/cross.svg\" />\n        </span>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"foter-logos\">\n            <a href=\"/\">\n                <img src=\"assets/images/Zoo_Logo_White_2.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </a>\n            <img class=\"big-logo\" src=\"assets/images/large-footer-logo.png\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"foote-links\">\n            <div class=\"section-links-container\">\n                <div class=\"section-links\">\n                    <a href=\"/\">home</a>\n                    <a href=\"#about\">about</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"section-links\">\n                    <a href=\"#agencies\">agencies</a>\n                    <a href=\"#ourPurpose\">our purpose</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"section-links\">\n                    <a href=\"#clientele\">clientele</a>\n                    <a href=\"/contact.html\">contact</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"section-links\">\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section-links-mb\">\n                <div class=\"section-links\">\n                    <a href=\"/\">home</a>\n                    <a href=\"#about\">about</a>\n                    <a href=\"#agencies\">agencies</a>\n                    <a href=\"#our purpose\">our purpose</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"section-links\">\n                    <a href=\"#clientele\">clientele</a>\n                    <a href=\"/contact.html\">contact</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/zoomedianetwork/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/intagram.svg\" />\n                </a>\n                <!-- <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/facebook.svg\" />\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/Twitter.svg\" />\n                </a> -->\n                <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/zoomedia-network/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/Linkedin.svg\" />\n                </a>\n                <!-- <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img src=\"assets/images/YouTube.svg\" />\n                </a> -->\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <hr>\n        <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n            <div class=\"copyright\">\n                <img src=\"assets/images/copyright.svg\" />\n                <p>Zoomedia 2026</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"return-to-top\">\n                <a class=\"scrollTop\">To the Top</a>\n                <img class=\"scrollTop\" src=\"assets/images/arrow-left.svg\" />\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- Swiper JS -->\n    <script src=\"assets/js/jquery-3.6.1.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper/swiper-bundle.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- <script src=\"/assets/js/main.js\"></script> -->\n\n\n    <script>\n        var menu = ['Foxymoron', 'Pollen', 'THE RABBIT HOLE', 'The Starter Labs', 'Phosphene', 'XP&D', 'TCM', 'Metaform'\n        ]\n        var swiper = new Swiper(\".mySwiper\", {\n            direction: \"vertical\",\n            slidesPerView: 1,\n            init: false,\n            watchOverflow: true,\n            watchSlidesProgress: true,\n            pauseOnMouseEnter: true,\n            allowTouchMove: true,\n\n            mousewheel: {\n                thresholdTime: 500,\n                releaseOnEdges: true,\n                // freeMode: true,\n                // watchSlidesProgress: true,\n            },\n            pagination: {\n                el: \".swiper-pagination\",\n                clickable: true,\n                dynamicBullets: true,\n                renderBullet: function (index, className) {\n                    return '<span class=\"' + className + '\">' + '<span>' + '' + (index + parseInt(1)) +\n                        '</span> <span class=\"textbullet\">' + (menu[index]) +\n                        '</span> <span class=\"arrow\"><img src=\"assets/images/bolletin-icon.svg\" style=\"width:16px;\">' +\n                        '</span> </span>';\n                },\n            }\n\n        });\n\n        var closeModal = document.getElementsByClassName(\"close\")[0];\n\n        closeModal.onclick = function () {\n            // modal.style.display = \"none\";\n            $('#myModal').css('display', 'none');\n            $('header').css('z-index', '999');\n            $(\".form-success\").removeClass(\"show\");\n            $(\".form-success\").addClass(\"hide\");\n            $(\".contact-from\").removeClass(\"hide\");\n            $(\".submit-btn\").removeClass(\"disable\");\n        }\n\n        var purposeSlider = new Swiper(\".purposeSlider\", {\n            loop: true,\n            effect: 'fade',\n            centeredSlides: true,\n            slidesPerView: 'auto',\n            allowTouchMove: false,\n            navigation: {\n                nextEl: \".purposeSlider .swiper-button-next\",\n                prevEl: \".purposeSlider .swiper-button-prev\",\n            },\n            thumbs: {\n                purposeSlider: mySwiper2,\n            },\n        });\n\n        var mySwiper2 = new Swiper(\".mySwiper2\", {\n            loop: true,\n            effect: 'coverflow',\n            centeredSlides: true,\n            allowTouchMove: false,\n            slidesPerView: 1,\n            coverflowEffect: {\n                rotate: 0,\n                stretch: 80,\n                depth: 200,\n                slideShadows: false,\n            },\n            breakpoints: {               \n                768: {\n                    slidesPerView: 3,\n                },\n            },\n\n            // Navigation arrows\n            navigation: {\n                nextEl: '.purposeSlider .swiper-button-next',\n                prevEl: '.purposeSlider .swiper-button-prev',\n            },\n        })\n\n        var clientelSwiper = new Swiper(\".clientele\", {\n            slidesPerView: 1,\n            navigation: {\n                nextEl: '.clientele .swiper-button-next',\n                prevEl: '.clientele .swiper-button-prev',\n            },\n        });\n\n        $(document).ready(function ($) {\n            const intro = document.querySelector(\".intro\");\n            const video = intro.querySelector(\"video\");\n            const text = intro.querySelector(\".down-arrow\");\n            video.pause();\n\n            //Scroll Magic scenes\n            const controller = new ScrollMagic.Controller();\n            let scene = new ScrollMagic.Scene({\n                    duration: 26000,\n                    triggerElement: intro,\n                    triggerHook: 0\n                })\n                .setPin(intro)\n                .addTo(controller);\n\n            //Scroll Magic video animation\n            let accelAmount = 0.1;\n            let scrollpos = 0;\n            let delay = 0;\n\n            scene.on(\"update\", e => {\n                scrollpos = e.scrollPos / 1000;\n            });\n\n\n            setInterval(() => {\n                delay += (scrollpos - delay) * accelAmount;\n                video.currentTime = delay;\n            }, 44.3);\n\n           \n\n            let scene2 = new ScrollMagic.Scene({\n                    offset: 10,\n                    triggerElement: \".mySwiper\",\n                    triggerHook: 0.01,\n                    duration: \"300%\"\n                })\n                .setPin(\".mySwiper\")\n                .setClassToggle('header', 'transparent')\n                .addTo(controller)\n\n            scene2.on(\"enter\", function (event) {\n                setTimeout(function () {\n                    swiper.init();\n                    swiper.enable();\n                }, 300)\n            });\n\n            scene2.on(\"leave\", function (event) {\n                setTimeout(function () {\n                    swiper.disable()\n                }, 500)\n            });\n\n            function sizeAll() {\n                var\tw = window.innerWidth;\n            \n                if ( w < 1024) {\n\n                    scene2.enabled(false);\n\n                    $(\"#about-video\").attr(\"src\", \"assets/videos/ZooMedia_Mobile.mp4\");\n\n                    var $triggerElement = $('.vertical-section-mb');\n                    var scrollListenerEnabled = true;\n\n                    function hasElementReachedTop(el) {\n                        var elementTop = el.offset().top;\n                        var viewportTop = $(window).scrollTop();\n                        // return elementTop <= viewportTop;\n                        return viewportTop >= elementTop;\n\n                    }\n\n                    function hasElementLeftScreen(el) {\n                        var elementBottom = el.offset().top + el.height();\n                        var viewportTop = $(window).scrollTop();\n                        return elementBottom < viewportTop;\n                    }\n \n                    function toggleClassOnScroll() {\n                        var element = $(\".vertical-section-mb\");\n                        \n                        \n                        if (hasElementReachedTop(element)) {                     \n                            $(\"header\").addClass(\"transparent\");\n                        } else {\n                            $(\"header\").removeClass(\"transparent\");\n                        }\n\n                        if (hasElementLeftScreen(element)) {\n                            $(\"header\").removeClass(\"transparent\");\n                        }\n\n                        // if ((scrollListenerEnabled) && (hasElementReachedTop($triggerElement))) {\n                        //     $('html, body').animate({ scrollTop: $triggerElement.offset().top }, 'slow');\n                        //     scrollListenerEnabled = false; \n                        //     console.log(scrollListenerEnabled);\n                        // }\n                        \n                    }\n\n                    $(window).on(\"scroll\", toggleClassOnScroll);\n\n                } else {\n                    scene2.enabled(true);\n                }\n            }\n\n            $(window).resize(sizeAll);\n            sizeAll();      \n\n            $('.myBtn').click(function (event) {\n                event.preventDefault();\n                $('#myModal').css('display', 'block');\n                $('header').css('z-index', '1');\n                $('#company').val($(this).attr('data-company'));\n            });\n\n            $(\"#contactform\").submit(function (event) {\n                event.preventDefault();\n                $(\".submit-btn\").attr(\"disabled\", true).addClass(\"disable\");\n                data = $(this).serialize();\n                console.log(data);\n                $.ajax({\n                    url: \"/contactform.php\",\n                    method: \"POST\",\n                    data: data,\n                }).done(function () {\n                    $('#contactform')[0].reset();\n                    $(\".form-success\").removeClass(\"hide\");\n                    $(\".form-success\").addClass(\"show\");\n                    $(\".contact-from\").addClass(\"hide\");\n\n                    $(\".submit-btn\").attr(\"disabled\", false);\n\n                });\n            });\n\n            $('.accordion').click(function () {\n                $(this).toggleClass('active-acc');\n                let panel = $(this).next();\n\n                if (panel[0].style.maxHeight) {\n                    panel[0].style.maxHeight = null;\n                } else {\n                    panel[0].style.maxHeight = panel[0].scrollHeight + \"px\";\n                }\n            });\n\n            $(\".scrollTop\").click(function() {\n                $(\"html, body\").animate({ \n                    scrollTop: 0 \n                }, \"slow\");\n                return false;\n            });\n\n            $(\"#mobNavIcon\").on(\"click\", function () {\n                $('nav').toggleClass(\"open\");\n                $(\"#mobNavIcon\").toggleClass(\"cross\");\n            })\n            $(\".nav-main nav a\").on(\"click\", function () {\n                console.log(\"close\");\n                $('nav').toggleClass(\"open\");\n                $(\"#mobNavIcon\").toggleClass(\"cross\");\n            })\n\n            $(\"#cautious-close\").on(\"click\", function () {\n                $('.cautious').css('display', 'none');\n            })\n\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>",
